    "lastUpdated": "2026-08-12",
    "source": "Compiled from all uploaded source decks/memos",
    "body": "\n    <p>This wiki was built from 14 separate training decks and memos spanning May–August 2026. Where sources\n    disagree, both figures are shown below with dates so nobody quotes a stale number. <strong>When in doubt,\n    confirm the live figure with Sales Ops / Finance before quoting it to a promoter or customer.</strong></p>\n    <table>\n      <tr><th>Topic</th><th>Older figure</th><th>Newer figure</th><th>Treat as current</th></tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>SIL Zero incentive rate</td>\n        <td>Padawan ₱150 / Jedi Knight ₱200 (pre-August 2026)</td>\n        <td>Padawan ₱100 / Jedi Knight ₱150 (Aug 1, 2026 memo — explicitly the \"after\" figures)</td>\n        <td><strong>Padawan ₱100 / Jedi Knight ₱150</strong> — confirmed by the most recent, most specific memo</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>PayHinga credit thresholds</td>\n        <td>3 consecutive on-time payments (1st credit) / 6 consecutive (2nd credit); min. 6-month term</td>\n        <td>2 consecutive (1st credit) / 4 consecutive (2nd credit); min. 3-month term (per T&C update, logged in DAY 2 deck as of 5/20/2026)</td>\n        <td><strong>2 / 4 consecutive payments, 3-month minimum term</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>SIL Basket Financing (BF)</td>\n        <td>Active product with its own reward table</td>\n        <td>Discontinued for both tiers, effective May 1, 2026 (Promoter Incentive Memo)</td>\n        <td><strong>Discontinued</strong> — do not offer</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>RBP Advanced segment add-on rate</td>\n        <td>2.96% (referenced as prior rate in the June 2026 ALCO request)</td>\n        <td>3.05% (target June 30, 2026 per ALCO request; matches the DAY 2 deck's Standard RBP table)</td>\n        <td><strong>3.05%</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n      </table>\n    <h4>Full source document list</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li>DAY 1 Training Presentation for Purple Pro (v2.4, updated through 07/06/2026)</li>\n      <li>DAY 2 Training Presentation for Purple Pro (v2.4, updated through 07/22/2026)</li>\n      <li>Promoter Pre-Submission Checklist Training Deck (07/16/2026)</li>\n      <li>SMART PID Customer Advisory Guide</li>\n      <li>Promoter Incentive Memo (effective May 1, 2026)</li>\n      <li>SIL Zero Adjustment Memo (effective Aug 1, 2026)</li>\n      <li>SIL Counteroffer Cascade Deck (Aug 2026)</li>\n      <li>PayHinga Cascade Deck (v1.0)</li>\n      <li>SIL Pricing Review Deck (May 2026, confidential)</li>\n      <li>SIL RAROC Improvements Deck (June 2026, confidential)</li>\n      <li>JIRA Signup Guide (EN/TL)</li>\n      <li>Viber Escalations Deck</li>\n      <li>Automating SIL Front Escalations Deck</li>\n      <li>SIL Wiki Additional Info Deck (Aug 19, 2026)</li>\n    </ul>\n  <p><em>Note: incentive/bonus-related change history is tracked separately in the internal confidential compensation reference, not in this public wiki.</em></p>"
